#: 68f5537feb2e4015925ccb392342f919
msgid "Distributed training with MPI"
msgstr "使用 MPI 进行分布式训练"

#: 7c25295e219943b99166f0430d488dd8
msgid ""
"Jittor can use MPI to launch data-parallel workers. Supported collective "
"operations may use NCCL on NVIDIA devices, while the training algorithm "
"remains in Python."
msgstr "计图可以通过 MPI 启动数据并行工作进程。受支持的集合通信在 NVIDIA 设备上可以使用 NCCL，而训练算法仍由 Python 实现。"

#: 9697be076a724e22aa29c144ff7997dc
msgid "Install and detect Open MPI"
msgstr "安装并检测 Open MPI"

#: 5bd39b39d47646a0aee9827434c6c247
msgid "On Debian or Ubuntu, install the launcher and development headers:"
msgstr "在 Debian 或 Ubuntu 上安装启动器和开发头文件："

#: fe737a10dc284634b02b5feaba8e1f32
msgid ""
"Jittor discovers `mpicc` from `PATH`. Set `mpicc_path` only when the "
"compiler wrapper is installed somewhere non-standard:"
msgstr "计图会从 `PATH` 中查找 `mpicc`。只有编译器包装器安装在非标准位置时，才需要设置 `mpicc_path`："

#: 1ff55482659f43cc92a8399615ac34e6
msgid "Start the same training program under `mpirun`:"
msgstr "使用 `mpirun` 启动同一个训练程序："

#: d90ad363f3db45ee8c015db5f7da84cc
msgid ""
"The dataset layer partitions data across workers, supported optimizers "
"synchronize gradients, and synchronized batch-normalization layers exchange "
"statistics. Treat a dataset's configured batch size as the global batch size"
" and verify the behavior of custom samplers."
msgstr "数据集层会把数据划分给各个工作进程，受支持的优化器会同步梯度，同步批归一化层会交换统计量。数据集配置的批大小应视为全局批大小；使用自定义采样器时请验证其行为。"

#: a46864bbc46e45cfa5bcf1274e479c4c
msgid "Side effects belong on rank zero"
msgstr "副作用只应在零号进程执行"

#: a7a2d5f6d54d45ae9e1a70a5c52c05de
msgid ""
"Every worker executes the Python program. Restrict filesystem and logging "
"side effects to rank zero:"
msgstr "每个工作进程都会执行 Python 程序。文件系统写入和日志等副作用应限制在零号进程："

#: 0d3c0bec4c334ce79c7a51693dd6f380
msgid ""
"Do not place Jittor operators in a rank-only branch. Workers must construct "
"compatible graphs and call collectives in the same order or they can "
"deadlock."
msgstr "不要在仅某个 rank 执行的分支中放置计图算子。各进程必须构建兼容的计算图，并以相同顺序调用集合通信，否则可能死锁。"

#: 1f846372e2564655b93732d069e04c28
msgid "Aggregate validation metrics"
msgstr "汇总验证指标"

#: 4934e65747d242e1b8acd50467387a77
msgid "Reduce values before using them as global metrics:"
msgstr "把局部值当作全局指标之前，应先进行归约："

#: 34dc5353a6bb4bd28c5bb20a3eec084a
msgid ""
"For an operation that should run in one process without manually branching, "
"use `jt.single_process_scope()`:"
msgstr "需要让某个操作只在一个进程执行而又不想手动分支时，可使用 `jt.single_process_scope()`："

#: 4e5173c0e61742f6b220984c9af64e91
msgid "Public MPI state and collectives"
msgstr "公开的 MPI 状态与集合通信接口"

#: 80f7fde6f4344763b85a935ed884fc2f
msgid "`jt.in_mpi` reports whether the process participates in an MPI world."
msgstr "`jt.in_mpi` 表示当前进程是否参与 MPI 通信域。"

#: 0693630914d248d6af5f5e1d6ab6b193
msgid "`jt.world_size` is the number of workers, or `1` outside MPI."
msgstr "`jt.world_size` 是工作进程数；不在 MPI 环境中时为 `1`。"

#: 1cbf5aaa05bc4160994b913b7b4f14a7
msgid "`jt.rank` is the current worker index, or `0` outside MPI."
msgstr "`jt.rank` 是当前工作进程编号；不在 MPI 环境中时为 `0`。"

#: 05e1f45a02a14a2cac4144a7f6b9a239
msgid "`Module.mpi_param_broadcast(root=0)` broadcasts module parameters."
msgstr "`Module.mpi_param_broadcast(root=0)` 广播模块参数。"

#: a4bdf661bea5435ba289e2dc973a1085
msgid "`Var.mpi_reduce(op=\"add\", root=0)` reduces a value to one worker."
msgstr "`Var.mpi_reduce(op=\"add\", root=0)` 把值归约到一个工作进程。"

#: 099e3819ce214f548a7c46e28cbbb25c
msgid "`Var.mpi_broadcast(root=0)` broadcasts a value from one worker."
msgstr "`Var.mpi_broadcast(root=0)` 从一个工作进程向其他进程广播值。"

#: a2ff1d8587674952a14d45506e79360a
msgid ""
"`Var.mpi_all_reduce(op=\"add\")` reduces and returns the result to every "
"worker."
msgstr "`Var.mpi_all_reduce(op=\"add\")` 归约值，并把结果返回给每个工作进程。"

#: 1291e97514044e03a7cd84451e8887ff
msgid ""
"Use `\"mean\"` when each worker contributes equally; otherwise reduce a sum "
"and a sample count separately."
msgstr "当每个工作进程的贡献权重相同时可使用 `\"mean\"`；否则应分别归约总和与样本数。"

#: 3fb9d6f2958b4ee688d32641fb24a6cc
msgid "Synchronized statistics"
msgstr "同步统计量"

#: 03113ff25b604b83bde0d94215bdab41
msgid "Custom synchronized normalization can reduce moments across workers:"
msgstr "自定义同步归一化可以在工作进程之间归约各阶矩："

#: 273d77b605c24bfcb22186975fa64f20
msgid ""
"Prefer Jittor's maintained synchronized normalization layer when it covers "
"the use case; the example illustrates collective ordering rather than a "
"complete replacement implementation."
msgstr "当计图维护的同步归一化层能满足需求时应优先使用它；这里的示例用于说明集合通信顺序，并不是完整的替代实现。"
